      "writtenOn": "2024-03-26T18:35:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if we are assuming that filePath points to elf64 files, should we validate that that is true?\n\nIn the Elf64_ehdr, there is an array of 16 chars e_ident[]:\n\n```\nIndexes [0-3] contains the magic number\ne_ident[0] \u003d  0x7F\ne_ident[1] \u003d  E\ne_ident[2] \u003d  L\ne_ident[3] \u003d  F\n```\n\nThe Index [4] indicates the ELF class, that could be ELFCLASS32 for 32-bit binaries or ELFCLASS64 for 64-bit binaries.\n\n\nWe can use Index [4] to validate the class:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:bionic/libc/kernel/uapi/linux/elf.h;l\u003d288\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:bionic/libc/kernel/uapi/linux/elf.h;l\u003d178",
